	pda (PDA): * 1 Notable File Found.\
	* Type\: .txt\
	* Category\: Document.
	pda (PDA): * Whatever you choose to do...
	do AudioController.toggle_pause()
	pda: * [shake]D o n ' t  p r e s s  \
	* T h e  b u t t o n.[/shake]
	ram (Worry): ???
else:
	do AudioController.toggle_pause()
	pda (PDG): * Login Unsuccessful.\
	* Deleting All Files...
	ram (Worry): [shake]NO![/shake]
	do AudioController.toggle_pause()
	pda (PDA): * Psych!\
	* Initiating Account \
	* Recovery Service...
	ram (Wow): ...
	pda (PDA): * Account Lock Message Found.\
	* Type\: .txt\
	* Category\: Personal File
	pda (PDA): * In case NAVI tries anything stupid.\
	* I need to let it be known.
	pda (PDA): * To anyone reading this message. \
	* Just know...
	do AudioController.toggle_pause()
	pda (PDA): * [shake]N A V I  h a s  b e e n\
	* L y i n g  t o  y o u.[/shake]
	pda (PDA): * [shake]D o  n o t  t r u s t  a n y  \
	* T e c h n o l o g y  y o u  f i n d.[/shake]
	pda (PDA): * T h e y -\
	* Message Terminated.
	pda (PDA): * NAVI Is Unable To Edit Files Without\
	* Explicit User Permission.
	pda (PDA): * Your Mission Is To \
	* Press The Button.\
	* Please Ensure Its Completion.
	ram (Default): ...
ram (Worry): [shake]I guess I have to choose now...[/shake]
ram (Default): C'mon Ramada! think outside the box!
